			"Message": "docs(Documentation): Comprehensive documentation update — sync with current implementation\n\nUpdate all 22 GitHub-facing technical docs to reflect changes from sessions\n2026-05-19 through 2026-06-11. Every doc cross-checked against current code.\n\nArchitecture.md: TierIPC routing section, Cocoon bootstrap stage reorder\n(RPCServer port 50052 before MountainConnection), Layer.succeed/ManagedRuntime,\nport correction (Mountain=50051, Cocoon=50052). Bootstrap sequence diagrams\nupdated throughout.\n\nVSCode-API-Coverage-Matrix.md: debug/tasks 🔴→🟡 (activeDebugSession, breakpoints,\nfetchTasks, executeTask, taskExecutions all partial); OSC 633 terminal shell\nintegration rows added (✅); registerInlineCompletionItemProvider added (🟡);\ncoverage summary table added; gap register updated.\n\nInterComponentProtocol.md: Full Tauri IPC command catalog by domain (Encryption,\nFileSystem, Terminal, NativeHost, Language); TierIPC routing table; Cocoon\nbootstrap order note; Channel lockstep note.\n\nEnvironmentVariables.md + BuildMatrix.md: TierIPC, BundleLevel, DisableUIFixes,\nHotReload, Watch, LiveReloadPort added; SignBundle.sh section.\n\nBuildPipeline.md + Building.md: 6-stage pipeline (PreBake in beforeBundleCommand,\nSignBundle.sh re-sign); all 16 build profiles; correct binary paths;\nextensions.manifest.json artifact; code-signing troubleshooting.\n\nEditorCore.md: service count corrected to 36; TierIPC routing subsection; eager\nManagedRuntime (globalThis.__CEL_WIND_RUNTIME__) documented.\n\nRustInfrastructure.md: Encryption provider (AES-256-GCM, machine UUID key);\nextension scan cache (<50ms vs 1200ms); boot performance table.\n\nPolyfills.md: Bridge module inventory (17 modules); correct bootstrap stages;\nconsole.* replacement strategy.\n\nAll 11 Workflow docs updated with current implementation details.\n\nGenerated-By: PostHog Code\nTask-Id: 88c0b3de-fc57-4c33-b3af-3a7b47e0c4e1",
